        "whenNotToUse": "Do not use when describing routine import duties, excise taxes, or tariffs (which tax items rather than prohibiting them). Do not confuse with temporary commercial strikes, port closures due to weather or labor disputes, or private corporate boycotts (which are voluntary consumer actions rather than government-enforced legal bans).",
